Subject: Re: Degrees of freedom with WLSMV as estimator and experimental data
Message-ID: <4KclG9QkVYE.MjD3V_NECAAJ@lavaan.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <4KclG9QkVYE.lNS7sVetBwAJ@lavaan.groups.google.com>
