All sorted -- if someone in the future needs:

To transform the mice object in something lavaan can use:

dat <- NULL

  for(i in 1:20) {

 dat[[i]] <- complete(x=YOURIMPUTEDDATA, action=i, include=FALSE)

  }

and then use the save function.
Best
Giovanni

